<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan-June global trade deficit narrows.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan-June global trade deficit narrows.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit narrowed 13.2 percent year-on-year to 718.46 billion escudos in the first six months of 1996, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		    Jan-Jun 96 Jan-June 95    June 96  May 96</p>
<p> Overall balance   -718.46    -827.75    -104.3   -129.5</p>
<p> Imports	    2,557.01   2,169.26     387.76   453.96</p>
<p> Exports	    1,838.55   1,555.04     283.51   324.43</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
